# Datastar as transport

Datastar is the browser **transport** for intent and morphing. It is not a
client application framework and not where domain data lives.

```text
data-on:click=@post("/actions/inc")
        │  HTTP POST, Datastar-Request: true
        ▼
@post:fragment or @post:command
        │
        ├─ HTML fragment → datastar-patch-elements
        └─ {} → empty SSE (Datastar) or 204 No Content (other clients)
```

Rocci generates the action helpers and pins the JS asset. Discriminate Datastar
with the request header, not `Accept`. Upstream expression language:
[data-star.dev](https://data-star.dev/).

**Related:** [Update the UI](/docs/how-to/update-the-ui/).
